  "description": "Örli Försztivál is an annual Hungarian furry mini con held for four days around the middle of June, organized by F Terminal. It started in 2021 as an outing in Budapest and grew into a convention, held first at Pákász Tanya in Agárd and, since 2025, at Villapark Várgesztes in Várgesztes. Unlike most furry conventions, it has no guests of honor or charity partners.",
